# Antigravity Rules for Project
- Stack: Python 3.11, FastAPI, Pydantic v2, asyncpg, aio_pika, redis-py.
- Code style: Fully typed, strict error handling, no raw stack traces in responses.
- Logging: Structured JSON (timestamp, service_name, level, request_id, message).
- Microservice boundaries: No shared databases! Each service has independent persistence.
- Healthchecks: Every service MUST expose GET /health and GET /ready.
- Completion rule: NEVER use placeholders like '# TODO' or 'pass' in core business logic.